{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-06-phl-tickets/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:36:21.126Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"2c34d42de77198da642f7f93f1a23ce6d8b5deb68f53995bbab50fb36191d671","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Bettina, here's the list for Kwame's account review. I used #coastal-team, #coastal-random, Moss's Coastal digests and cheat sheet, and your cutover recap note. Pellow Home Living items, including PD-4821 and #8812, are left out.\n\n**Pellucid Harbor Logistics (PHL)**\n- **#4419** (ticket, open): the `Yard_Dwell_Summary` report times out when filtered by container length. Source: Moss's Coastal cheat sheet.\n- **PD-8841** (ticket): chassis pool holds on double-booked gates, Gate 4B. Source: your 2025-12-08 cutover recap.\n- No feature requests found.\n\n**Driftmoor Marine Freight (DMF)**\n- **#882** (feature request): bulk-clear button for departed barges, requested by warehouse managers. Source: Moss's cheat sheet.\n- **#4419** also shows up under Driftmoor, as a barge slip 7 schedule sync ticket. Source: Moss's 2025-11-02 digest.\n- A tide-table import macro failed on Terminal B. Engineering gave a manual CSV patch. No ticket number was recorded.\n- A patched manifest CSV was requested before the 06:00 shift (2025-11-02 digest). No ticket number was recorded.\n\n**Please check before the review**\n- **#4419 conflict:** Moss's two notes attach #4419 to different accounts and issues, Pellucid's report timeout in one and Driftmoor's barge slip sync in the other. One of them is probably a typo, so confirm the number with Kwame or support.\n- **Thin coverage:** the channels have no PHL or DMF ticket discussion. #coastal-team only has the PHL/Pellow naming mix-up from February. The list therefore comes almost entirely from Moss's notes and may not be complete. The ticketing system itself isn't something I can read."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
